# Windows Node & NPM Toolchain Invariant

When executing verification, test, lint, or build commands on Windows:
1. Prepend the cached Node v22 path to PATH before executing commands:
   `$env:PATH = "C:\Users\MichaelLaurenzo\.cache\botbound-node22\node-v22.23.3-win-x64;$env:PATH"`
2. Always execute `npm.cmd` rather than `npm` to bypass PowerShell script execution policy restrictions on `npm.ps1`.
3. Ensure Git commit operations run with this PATH set so `.husky/pre-commit` finds `node` in its Bash subshell.
